{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "orchestration/a-background-worker-tool-answers-at-once-and-hands-the-outcome-back",
  "title": "A Supervisor that does not wait for its workers answers a delegate_to_<worker> call at once, the task's id in the answer, and runs the worker in the background; the worker is freed in the room before its outcome is handed back to the supervisor as an instruction addressed to it, at the chain depth of the turn that called, its output set apart as data; the worker's entries name the background mode, and the run's one terminal entry is the orchestration's",
  "rules": [
    "§19.7.3",
    "§23.3"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: tests/test_supervisor.py TestPerWorkerDelegation::test_no_wait_delegates_background; tests/orchestration/test_supervisor_inline.py TestWaitForResultFalse::test_async_delegation_returns_task_id; tests/orchestration/test_supervisor_strategy.py TestBackgroundDedup::test_pending_clears_after_completion (the worker freed before its outcome is handed back: the hand-back's turn delegates again); tests/orchestration/test_supervisor_text_background.py test_a_per_worker_background_task_is_the_task_runner_s (its answer). orchestration/strategies/supervisor/_inject_per_worker.py _delegate_in_background, _background_run, _worker_told, _worker_ended, _dispatched; orchestration/_background.py run_in_background; orchestration/_worker_run.py follow_worker; tasks/handback.py hand_back, result_text, RESULT_TURN_NOTE, CALLER_HANDS_BACK (the task runner hands nothing back itself). The turns' notes listing the room's tasks (RMK-1284) are left out.",
  "setup": {
    "channels": [
      {
        "id": "sms",
        "type": "sms",
        "category": "transport"
      },
      {
        "id": "sup",
        "type": "ai",
        "agent": {
          "role": "Coordinator"
        },
        "model": {
          "rounds": [
            {
              "calls": [
                {
                  "id": "c1",
                  "name": "delegate_to_researcher",
                  "arguments": {
                    "task": "Find the facts."
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "On it."
            },
            {
              "calls": [
                {
                  "id": "c2",
                  "name": "delegate_to_researcher",
                  "arguments": {
                    "task": "Check them."
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Here are the facts."
            },
            {
              "text": "They check out."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "researcher",
        "type": "ai",
        "agent": {
          "role": "Researcher"
        },
        "model": {
          "rounds": [
            {
              "text": "The facts.",
              "gate": "w"
            },
            {
              "text": "Checked."
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "rooms": [
      {
        "id": "r1",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "channel_id": "sms"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "strategies": [
      {
        "id": "team",
        "supervisor": {
          "supervisor": "sup",
          "workers": [
            "researcher"
          ],
          "wait_for_result": false
        }
      }
    ],
    "hooks": [
      {
        "name": "delivered",
        "trigger": "after_deliver",
        "execution": "async"
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "call": "install_strategy",
      "room_id": "r1",
      "strategy": "team"
    },
    {
      "call": "process_inbound",
      "room_id": "r1",
      "message": {
        "channel_id": "sms",
        "sender_id": "u1",
        "content": {
          "type": "text",
          "body": "Find it."
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "blocked": false,
          "error": null
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wait_for": "w"
    },
    {
      "open": "w"
    },
    {
      "idle": true
    },
    {
      "call": "status.recent",
      "agent_id": "researcher",
      "expect": {
        "result": [
          {
            "action": "task",
            "status": "pending",
            "detail": "Find the facts.",
            "metadata": {
              "room_id": "r1",
              "mode": "per_worker_async",
              "task_run": true,
              "task_id": {
                "$present": true
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "action": "task",
            "status": "completed",
            "detail": "The facts.",
            "metadata": {
              "room_id": "r1",
              "mode": "per_worker_async",
              "task_run": true,
              "task_id": {
                "$present": true
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "action": "task",
            "status": "pending",
            "detail": "Check them."
          },
          {
            "action": "task",
            "status": "completed",
            "detail": "Checked."
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "status.recent",
      "agent_id": "orchestration",
      "expect": {
        "result": [
          {
            "action": "worker",
            "status": "completed",
            "detail": "completed",
            "metadata": {
              "room_id": "r1",
              "mode": "per_worker_async",
              "worker": "researcher"
            }
          },
          {
            "action": "worker",
            "status": "completed",
            "detail": "completed",
            "metadata": {
              "room_id": "r1",
              "mode": "per_worker_async",
              "worker": "researcher"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "expect": {
    "timeline": {
      "r1": [
        {
          "source": {
            "channel_id": "sms"
          },
          "content": {
            "type": "text",
            "body": "Find it."
          }
        },
